        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global Standard Commercial Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nANSI Grade 2 certified deadbolt  is adjustable to fit 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches door thicknesses; and it will fit a backsets of 2-3/8 or 2-3/4 inches.  Easy installation on wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Global Standard Commercial Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.2 grade 2 requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for <b>2-3/4\"</b> or <b>2-3/8\"</b></li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1-1/8\" x 2-1/4\" UL Listed, 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\"  no-lip square corner</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: 5 pin solid brass Schlage \"C\" keyway standard.</li>\r\n<li>Trim Ring: Solid Security collar reinforced.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Standard <b>Brushed Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Manufactures Warranty: Lifetime Mechanical - 10 Year Finish</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>",
