                "description": "An ANSI Grade 2 single cylinder deadbolt. This standard commercial deadbolt is adjustable to fit 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches door thicknesses; and it will fit door backsets of 2-3/4 inches, Brushed Chrome finish.",
